Embedded registry data (internal/vendordb/data)
================================================================================
MAC address block assignments: IEEE Registration Authority public listings
(MA-L, MA-M, MA-S, IAB), https://standards-oui.ieee.org/
SNMP Private Enterprise Numbers: IANA, https://www.iana.org/assignments/enterprise-numbers
Fetch dates and checksums: internal/vendordb/data/SOURCES.txt

The registry data is not covered by the MIT license of atlas-portmap. It is
factual assignment data from the registries above, of which only the prefix or
enterprise number and the organisation name are kept (postal addresses, contact
names and email addresses are dropped), and it remains subject to the IEEE's
and IANA's own terms. Neither the IEEE nor IANA is affiliated with or endorses
atlas-portmap.
